# Google sign-in (optional). Username and password always work with the test users
# in docs/usuarios-de-prueba.md; the «Continuar con Google» button appears only with a client ID.
# Create an OAuth client of type "Web application" in Google Cloud Console and add the
# authorized JavaScript origins (http://localhost:5173 and https://saasguard-express.vercel.app).
VITE_GOOGLE_CLIENT_ID=
# Google accounts allowed to sign in, with their role: email:role,email:role
# Roles: admin, it, people, finance, viewer. Keep real emails in .env.local or Vercel, not in Git.
VITE_GOOGLE_ALLOWED_EMAILS=
# Optional: any account of this Google Workspace domain enters with read-only access.
VITE_GOOGLE_ALLOWED_DOMAIN=
